    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Furrykin (Mustelid)</em> at level 17; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You latch onto a problem and refuse to become a footnote.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Relentless Bite (1/Long Rest).</strong> For 1 minute, once per turn when you hit a creature, you can reduce their speed to 0 until the start of their next turn (Strength save resists; DC = 8 + PB + Con).</p>",
